msgstr "geografska širina tačke"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:508
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "longitude of its point"
msgstr "geografska dužina tačke"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1188
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An event's area or route always has its pin as well, and an event never has an area and a route at once."
msgstr "Područje ili ruta događaja uvek ima i svoj pin, a događaj nikad nema i područje i rutu u isto vreme."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:509
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "its area on a map, as its border"
msgstr "njegovo područje na mapi, kao granica"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:510
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "its route on a map, as its line"
msgstr "njegova ruta na mapi, kao linija"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:263
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "newest value, for a member"
msgstr "poslednja vrednost, za člana"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:346
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "text as a search reads it, in Latin and without diacritics"
msgstr "tekst kako ga pretraga čita, latinicom i bez kvačica"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1903
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Unread is measured from one marker"
msgstr "Nepročitano se meri od jednog markera"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1879
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A group sends notices to those who follow it"
msgstr "Grupa šalje obaveštenja onima koji je prate"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:998
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A notice a group sent to those who follow it: one text, never edited. It remembers who sent it, how many followers it reached and the preview of its first link. Deleting it deletes it for everyone who received it."
msgstr "Obaveštenje koje je grupa poslala onima koji je prate: jedan tekst, koji se nikad ne menja. Pamti ko ga je poslao, do koliko pratilaca je stiglo i pregled njegovog prvog linka. Brisanje ga briše svima koji su ga primili."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1005
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A notice that reached one profile, and whether it was read. It is written when the notice is sent, for every follower who sees the group then, so it stays after unfollowing. Unread ones make the counter of notices."
msgstr "Obaveštenje koje je stiglo do jednog profila, i da li je pročitano. Upisuje se kad se obaveštenje pošalje, za svakog pratioca koji tada vidi grupu, pa ostaje i kad pratilac prestane da prati grupu. Nepročitana čine brojač obaveštenja."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1881
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A profile can follow a <Group>group</Group> it sees, a public one without being a member: that is a <GroupFollow>following</GroupFollow>. The root, direct conversations and threads are not followed. Whoever holds the permission to send notices sends a <GroupNotice>notice</GroupNotice>, and `admin` holds it as it holds every permission. The notice is written as a <GroupNoticeReceipt>received notice</GroupNoticeReceipt> for every follower who sees the group at that moment, never for its author, so it stays after unfollowing, and a later follower finds the older ones on the group's page. Unread received notices make their own counter, apart from unread messages, and opening the list of notices or the group's notices reads them. A push goes out while both the following and the profile allow it. Deleting a notice takes it from everyone who received it. The preview of a notice's first link comes a moment after it is sent, and whoever may delete the notice may remove the preview, for everyone. At the root, the groups a profile follows stay on its lists and on the map of groups while the other public groups are hidden, and its sub-groups can be narrowed to them."
msgstr "Profil može da prati <Group>grupu</Group> koju vidi, javnu i kad nije njen član: to je <GroupFollow>praćenje</GroupFollow>. Koren, direktni razgovori i niti se ne prate. <GroupNotice>Obaveštenje</GroupNotice> šalje onaj ko ima dozvolu za slanje obaveštenja, a `admin` je ima kao i svaku dozvolu. Obaveštenje se upisuje kao <GroupNoticeReceipt>primljeno obaveštenje</GroupNoticeReceipt> za svakog pratioca koji u tom trenutku vidi grupu, nikad za njegovog autora, pa ostaje i kad pratilac prestane da prati grupu, a kasniji pratilac starija obaveštenja nalazi na stranici grupe. Nepročitana primljena obaveštenja imaju svoj brojač, odvojen od nepročitanih poruka, a otvaranje spiska obaveštenja ili obaveštenja grupe ih čita. Push notifikacija ide dok je dozvoljavaju i praćenje i profil. Brisanje obaveštenja ga uklanja svima koji su ga primili. Pregled prvog linka u obaveštenju stiže trenutak posle slanja, a ko sme da obriše obaveštenje, može da ukloni pregled, svima. U korenu grupe koje profil prati ostaju na spiskovima i na mapi grupa i kad su ostale javne grupe sakrivene, a podgrupe mogu da se suze na njih."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:991
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A profile follows a group, to receive its notices. Anyone who sees the group may follow it, a public one without being a member. It says whether the group's notices push to the follower's devices."
msgstr "Profil prati grupu da bi primao njena obaveštenja. Grupu može da prati svako ko je vidi, javnu i kad nije njen član. Pamti da li obaveštenja grupe idu kao push notifikacije na uređaje pratioca."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:745
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Following"
msgstr "Praćenje"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:706
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Following and notices"
msgstr "Praćenje i obaveštenja"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:746
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Notice"
msgstr "Obaveštenje"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:747
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Received notice"
msgstr "Primljeno obaveštenje"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1278
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The text has 1 to 2,000 characters, and not only spaces."
msgstr "Tekst ima od 1 do 2.000 znakova, i nisu svi razmaci."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:615
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "follower"
msgstr "pratilac"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:620
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "how many got it"
msgstr "koliko ih je primilo"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:624
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "notice"
msgstr "obaveštenje"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:180
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "push of notices"
msgstr "push za obaveštenja"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:616
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "push to devices"
msgstr "push na uređaje"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:625
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "read at"
msgstr "vreme čitanja"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:623
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "recipient"
msgstr "primalac"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:618
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "who sent it"
msgstr "ko ga je poslao"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1969
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A <Group>group</Group> an app made with a key of its own is a record, such as one row of an open dataset brought in with thousands of others. The key is set once and is unique under its parent, so bringing the same list in again makes no duplicates. A record is an ordinary group, seen by whoever may see it, but it stands only on its own map: the root's map and the place picker of events leave records out, and the unread counts of the profile that brought them in do not follow them. Pages hear of a hundred records made at once as of one change."
msgstr "<Group>Grupa</Group> koju je aplikacija napravila sa sopstvenim ključem je zapis, kao jedan red otvorenih podataka unet sa hiljadama drugih. Ključ se upisuje jednom i jedinstven je ispod roditelja, pa ponovni unos istog spiska ne pravi duplikate. Zapis je obična grupa, vidi je ko sme da je vidi, ali stoji samo na svojoj mapi: mapa korena i biranje mesta za događaje izostavljaju zapise, a nepročitano profila koji ih je uneo ne prati ih. Stranice za stotinu zapisa napravljenih odjednom saznaju kao za jednu promenu."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1148
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An app's key for a group has from 1 to 64 characters."
msgstr "Ključ aplikacije za grupu ima od 1 do 64 znaka."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1627
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For a viewer who may edit its group, an app can make <Group>groups</Group> right under it, change them and take them back, and put them on a map with a pin. A new one opens its chat if the app's group has. It can inherit the members of the app's group, all of them or only those with the roles the app picks. It can also make up to a hundred at once, all or none, each with a key of its own, so that the same list brought in again makes no duplicates: that is how the rows of an open dataset become groups on a map. That is how one app writes what another shows, and a feed gets its editors' desk."
msgstr "Za gledaoca koji sme da menja njenu grupu, aplikacija pravi <Group>grupe</Group> odmah ispod sebe, menja ih, povlači i stavlja na mapu sa pinom. Nova otvara razgovor ako ga je otvorila grupa aplikacije. Može da nasleđuje članove grupe aplikacije, sve ili samo one sa ulogama koje aplikacija izabere. Može da napravi i do stotinu odjednom, sve ili nijednu, svaku sa sopstvenim ključem, pa ponovni unos istog spiska ne pravi duplikate: tako redovi otvorenih podataka postaju grupe na mapi. Tako jedna aplikacija piše ono što druga prikazuje, a feed dobija uredništvo."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1967
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Records stay on their own map"
msgstr "Zapisi ostaju na svojoj mapi"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:228
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "an app's own key"
msgstr "ključ aplikacije"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1163
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A description only some roles see never goes to guests."
msgstr "Opis koji vide samo neke uloge nikad ne ide gostima."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1742
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A guest saves, reacts and votes in nothing. Of an app's values it gets only the settings and counts that public rules show everyone."
msgstr "Gost ništa ne čuva, ne reaguje i ne glasa. Od vrednosti aplikacije dobija samo podešavanja i rezime, kad ih javna pravila pokazuju svima."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1895
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A public group can open its description to guests"
msgstr "Javna grupa može da otvori opis i gostima"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1897
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Anyone with the link of a public <Group>group</Group> sees its name, its picture and a piece of its description, without an account. Whoever may edit the group can open the whole description to such guests, and then each <GroupAltDescription>alternative description</GroupAltDescription> marked for them goes along; one that only some <GroupRole>roles</GroupRole> see never does. A description that is an app runs for guests too, and only reads: the public groups below it, the descriptions of those open to guests, a map of them, public <Poll>polls</Poll> and what public rules show. The chat, the members and who reacted stay behind the login, and search engines do not list the page. A group that stops being public closes it, and keeps the choice for when it opens again."
msgstr "Svako ko ima link javne <Group>grupe</Group> vidi njen naziv, sliku i deo opisa, i bez naloga. Ko sme da uređuje grupu može takvim gostima da otvori ceo opis, i tada uz njega idu i <GroupAltDescription>alternativni opisi</GroupAltDescription> označeni za njih; onaj koji vide samo neke <GroupRole>uloge</GroupRole> nikad ne ide. Opis koji je aplikacija radi i za goste, i samo čita: javne grupe ispod sebe, opise onih otvorenih za goste, njihovu mapu, javna <Poll>glasanja</Poll> i ono što pokazuju javna pravila. Razgovor, članovi i ko je reagovao ostaju iza prijave, a pretraživači tu stranu ne prikazuju. Grupa koja prestane da bude javna zatvara je i pamti izbor za kad se ponovo otvori."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1715
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Opens to guests"
msgstr "Otvara se gostima"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1717
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Where a public <Group>group</Group> opens its description to guests, its app runs for people without an account too. It then lists the public groups below it and shows the descriptions of those open to guests, maps them and reads public <Poll>polls</Poll>, and a tap on a group opens its text over the app. That is how a feed or a map can be read by anyone with the link."
msgstr "Kad javna <Group>grupa</Group> otvori opis gostima, njena aplikacija radi i za ljude bez naloga. Tada nabraja javne grupe ispod sebe i pokazuje opise onih otvorenih za goste, stavlja ih na mapu i čita javna <Poll>glasanja</Poll>, a dodir na grupu otvara njen tekst preko aplikacije. Tako vesti ili mapu može da čita svako ko ima link."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:206
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "description open to guests"
msgstr "opis otvoren za goste"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:278
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "guests read it too"
msgstr "vide ga i gosti"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1378
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A month is written as its first day."
msgstr "Mesec se upisuje kao njegov prvi dan."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1089
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A technical table with no links to the rest of the domain: what one hour of one thing Potok runs on cost at `Fly.io`, a machine, the database, the stored files, the IP addresses or the data sent out, estimated by Potok itself from what `Fly.io` reports and its price list."
msgstr "Tehnička tabela bez veza sa ostatkom domena: koliko je na `Fly.io` koštao jedan sat jedne stvari na kojoj Potok radi, mašine, baze, sačuvanih fajlova, IP adresa ili poslatih podataka, kako ga Potok sam procenjuje iz onoga što `Fly.io` javlja i iz cenovnika."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:710
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hosting costs"
msgstr "Troškovi hostinga"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:758
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hour of costs"
msgstr "Sat troškova"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:759
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Invoice"
msgstr "Račun"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1374
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Neither the cost nor the amount is negative."
