#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1591
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A collection's rule can carry the graph of a process, which Potok checks as the app saves it and runs for every new <Value>value</Value>: messages, sub-groups and pushes signed by the process's own <Profile>profile</Profile>, tasks for the people of a role, deadlines and timers. The app lists the <ValueProcess>instances</ValueProcess> of the values its viewer may read, lets whoever holds a task's role finish it, and lets its editors take a failed one up again or cancel one. Each move reaches the app live. Of the processes the group's editors draw in Potok, the app sees what waits for its viewer, opens a form of theirs in Potok's own dialog and may finish a decision, and opens the Start of one the viewer may start by hand the same way; their drawings stay out of its sight."
msgstr "Pravilo kolekcije može da nosi graf procesa, koji Potok proverava kad ga aplikacija sačuva i izvršava za svaku novu <Value>vrednost</Value>: poruke, podgrupe i push koje potpisuje sopstveni <Profile>profil</Profile> procesa, zadatke za ljude jedne uloge, rokove i tajmere. Aplikacija prikazuje <ValueProcess>instance</ValueProcess> vrednosti koje gledalac sme da čita, pušta onoga ko ima ulogu zadatka da ga završi, a urednike da palu instancu ponovo pokrenu ili da otkažu neku. Svaki korak stiže u aplikaciju odmah. Od procesa koje urednici grupe nacrtaju u Potoku aplikacija vidi ono što čeka njenog gledaoca, njihovu formu otvara u Potokovom dijalogu i može da završi odluku, a isto tako otvara i Pokreni procesa koji gledalac sme ručno da pokrene; same crteže ne vidi."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:2031
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Editors can draw a process in Potok"
msgstr "Urednici mogu da nacrtaju proces u Potoku"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1290
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only a process drawn in Potok keeps a graph here."
msgstr "Graf ovde čuva samo proces nacrtan u Potoku."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:949
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The process of one collection of an app, with the profile that signs what it does and its owner, the editor who saved its rule. Removing the rule makes it inactive, and its profile stays as the author of what it wrote. A process an editor drew in Potok keeps its graph and the places of its steps here, where no save of the app reaches it; a collection has at most one process of the app's own, and may have drawn ones beside it."
msgstr "Proces jedne kolekcije aplikacije, sa profilom koji potpisuje ono što proces radi i vlasnikom, urednikom koji je sačuvao njegovo pravilo. Kad se pravilo ukloni, proces postaje neaktivan, a njegov profil ostaje autor onoga što je napisao. Proces koji je urednik nacrtao u Potoku ovde čuva svoj graf i mesta svojih koraka, gde ga čuvanje aplikacije ne dotiče. Kolekcija ima najviše jedan proces same aplikacije, a pored njega može da ima i nacrtane."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:389
