#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1309
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A process starts on a value, a message, a sub-group, a schedule, by hand, when another process calls it or on a signal."
msgstr "Proces počinje na vrednosti, poruci, podgrupi, po rasporedu, ručno, kad ga pozove drugi proces ili na signal."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:1363
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A run is never less than zero processes deep."
msgstr "Pokretanje nikad nije manje od nula procesa duboko."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:914
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "One run of a process: the graph it started with, the element it stands on and when it wakes next. What set it going is a value of a collection or a chat message, a new sub-group, or nothing for a run started by hand or by a schedule, which keeps the fields its texts read. A run another process started, by a call or a signal, is one level deeper than that one, shares its subject and keeps the fields it was given; a caller that waits for it points at it, and what each wait brought back stays with the run that waited. A value or a sub-group has at most one instance of each process that its trigger started. Deleting it or the process takes the instance along, and what it wrote stays."
msgstr "Jedno pokretanje procesa: graf sa kojim je krenulo, element na kome stoji i kada se sledeći put budi. Pokrenula ga je vrednost iz kolekcije ili poruka u razgovoru, nova podgrupa, ili ništa, kad ga je neko pokrenuo ručno ili ga je pokrenuo raspored; tada čuva polja koja čitaju njegovi tekstovi. Pokretanje koje je pokrenuo drugi proces, pozivom ili signalom, jedan je nivo dublje od njega, ima isti predmet i čuva polja koja je dobilo; pozivalac koji ga čeka pokazuje na njega, a ono što je svako čekanje donelo ostaje uz pokretanje koje je čekalo. Vrednost ili podgrupa ima najviše jednu instancu svakog procesa koju je pokrenuo njegov okidač. Brisanje nje ili procesa briše i instancu, a ono što je napisala ostaje."

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:475
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "how many processes deep"
msgstr "koliko procesa duboko"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:430
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "run it waits for"
msgstr "pokretanje koje čeka"

#: lib/potok_ide_web/domain_copy.ex:478
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "what its waits brought back"
msgstr "šta su čekanja donela"

